[{:db/id "q-32639/selection/488c21470ef2f4518e06b7b1e17503545cd26974a369f1e08bad6e157cb2caa5" :answer/id #uuid "b4c4d1b5-8de7-5b54-bca2-e25be0d8790a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6{sec}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639/selection/d1794ce64de829797d51447e036ccf3eec18010444c70f16d2fe15b546a9e865" :answer/id #uuid "d9a88da9-95f1-548a-8fb0-6581d617cc6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639/selection/19bc36e401b12a4f2d1eefbf9319eb2693858e64f3ca11ea6a0b7b3bfcfa9c2a" :answer/id #uuid "1696969b-4a3e-595e-8a84-bd0fb84d8a4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639/selection/5a900b93fb71edf2a1c74b9c0cc0e4e4dbd6b7bde8db95fc1efc9395dbcf0c81" :answer/id #uuid "cd2e7d6d-9564-50dc-92ad-175d099572f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(2{g}^{-1}(x)-1)}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639/selection/00a1a14477d297c7535ab1f7b63b13fb5ff828dc5fb28a2eecb857b968bb62fa" :answer/id #uuid "2b4a768f-5a72-55e9-9fb0-6710362e588c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6{csc}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8ee805f1-19ee-56d6-bc12-15998edfd539" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-32639/selection/d1794ce64de829797d51447e036ccf3eec18010444c70f16d2fe15b546a9e865" :answer-field/choices ["q-32639/selection/488c21470ef2f4518e06b7b1e17503545cd26974a369f1e08bad6e157cb2caa5" "q-32639/selection/d1794ce64de829797d51447e036ccf3eec18010444c70f16d2fe15b546a9e865" "q-32639/selection/19bc36e401b12a4f2d1eefbf9319eb2693858e64f3ca11ea6a0b7b3bfcfa9c2a" "q-32639/selection/5a900b93fb71edf2a1c74b9c0cc0e4e4dbd6b7bde8db95fc1efc9395dbcf0c81" "q-32639/selection/00a1a14477d297c7535ab1f7b63b13fb5ff828dc5fb28a2eecb857b968bb62fa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-32639" :question/id #uuid "10f78469-c4d5-5a89-876b-c2c2c094075b" :question/math-academy-id "q-32639" :question/problem "If $g(x)=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x-1)-1,$ find ${({g}^{-1})}^{′}(x)$ as a function of ${g}^{-1}(x).$" :question/worked-solution "**Step 1:** First, we write the inverse function implicitly. The given function is $y=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x-1)-1,$ and to write the inverse function implicitly, we swap $x$ and $y$ as follows:\n\n$$\nx=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6y-1)-1\n$$\n\nNote that in the equation above, we have $y={g}^{-1}(x).$\n\n**Step 2:** Next, we differentiate. The overall goal is to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ but the equation is already solved for $x,$ so we compute $\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}y}$ and then take the reciprocal:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}y} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6y-1)-1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}y} & =-{csc}^{2}⁡(6y-1)\\cdot 6 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}y} & =-6{csc}^{2}⁡(6y-1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{1}{6{csc}^{2}⁡(6y-1)} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(6y-1)}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3:** Lastly, we write the result in terms of ${g}^{-1}(x).$ Since $y={g}^{-1}(x),$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[{g}^{-1}(x)] & =-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)}{6} \\\\ {({g}^{-1})}^{′}(x) & =-\\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(6{g}^{-1}(x)-1)}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-32639/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0196af83-9ef6-5bab-9f50-0aacf488f0cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32639"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73064/selection/07070a8ce3fccbafd09b7cc4eaa42952b9b588b6cda941925cee7ff27fe3f6c1" :answer/id #uuid "875dde83-6d5d-5126-a003-27e5a8afd84c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/valu